00:13:19.098 --> 00:13:20.733
Number two, strengths.

00:13:20.733 --> 00:13:21.768
Are you a salesman?

00:13:21.768 --> 00:13:23.269
Are the accountant?

00:13:23.269 --> 00:13:24.671
Do you have financial strength?

00:13:24.671 --> 00:13:25.638
Do you have sales strength?

00:13:25.638 --> 00:13:26.673
Are you operationally?

00:13:26.673 --> 00:13:27.974
Are you good at HR?

00:13:27.974 --> 00:13:29.375
Whatever you're best at,

00:13:29.375 --> 00:13:30.543
do that,

00:13:30.543 --> 00:13:32.945
surround yourself with the
other three or four pillars

00:13:32.945 --> 00:13:35.515
