and that one moment

00:14:19.592 --> 00:14:20.393
easily,

00:14:20.393 --> 00:14:22.161
my mom did most of the work.

00:14:22.161 --> 00:14:23.296
My mom did most of the work.

00:14:23.296 --> 00:14:24.297
My dad was at work.

